("Blind Fighting", "Fighting Style", "Fighting Style feature", P24, "Blindsight 10 feet: you can see invisible creatures and things in darkness within 10 feet."),
("Dueling", "Fighting Style", "Fighting Style feature", P24, "+2 damage with a melee weapon held in one hand when you have no other weapon."),
