("Protection", "Fighting Style", "Fighting Style feature", P24, "With a shield, use your reaction to give an attack against an ally within 5 feet disadvantage."),
("Thrown Weapon Fighting", "Fighting Style", "Fighting Style feature", P24, "+2 damage with thrown weapons, and you can draw them as part of the attack."),
