("Boon of Energy Resistance", "Epic Boon", "Level 19+", P24, "+1 to any ability (to 30). Resistance to two of acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, poison, psychic, radiant or thunder, and you can redirect that damage at someone else as a reaction."),
("Boon of Fortitude", "Epic Boon", "Level 19+", P24, "+1 to any ability (to 30). Your hit point maximum rises by 40, and when you heal you can add your Constitution modifier once per turn."),
("Boon of Recovery", "Epic Boon", "Level 19+", P24, "+1 to any ability (to 30). Once per long rest, when you would drop to 0, drop to 1 and heal half your maximum. You also have a pool of 10d10 to heal yourself as a bonus action."),
